ogress-header"}><span className={"progress-label text-primary-ink"}>{"Our 2026 specification"}</span><span className={"progress-value tabular-nums text-primary-ink"}>{"175"}</span></div><div className={"progress progress--primary bg-(--custom-line)"}><div className={"progress-bar"} data-progress={"51"} data-duration={"1400"}></div></div></div></figure><h2>{"And then use less of it"}</h2><p>{"The mix is half the story. Shorter spans, post-tensioned slabs and a timber frame above the podium took another fifth out of Meridian's structure. The result: 31% less embodied carbon than a benchmark tower of the same size."}</p><aside className={"custom-takeaways grid gap-4 bg-soft p-8"} aria-label={"Key takeaways"}><span className={"eyebrow"}>{"Key Takeaways"}</span><ul className={"m-0 grid gap-3 ps-5"}><li>{"Count carbon beside cost and area from the first sketch."}</li><li>{"Specify strength at 56 days so half the cement can go."}</li><li>{"Shorter spans and lighter frames beat any single material swap."}</li></ul></aside></div></div></div></article><section id={"af-ar-related"} className={"section section-tertiary"} aria-labelledby={"af-ar-related-title"}><div className={"container"}><div className={"mb-12 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-8 lg:mb-16"}><h2 id={"af-ar-related-title"} className={"m-0 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(2.5rem,1.5rem+3.4vw,5.5rem)] leading-none text-balance"} data-anim={"fade-up"}>{"Keep reading."}</h2><a href={"#page=demo-architecture-firm-1-insights"} className={"btn btn-outline-light"} data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"150"}>{"All Insights"}<i className={"ph ph-arrow-right"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i></a></div><div className={"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 xl:gap-8"}><a href={"#page=demo-architecture-firm-1-insights"} className={"group block no-underline"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"img-frame img-frame-zoom block aspect-3/2"}><img className={"h-full w-full object-cover"} src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/asset